# API6 - Unrestricted Access to Sensitive Business Flows
# Detects coupon reuse by successful-request rate.
# Maps to OWASP API6, NIST CSF 2.0 DE.CM
#
# Validated 19 Sep 2026: detected 40 validations of one coupon in a minute.
# Note: this rule counts successful requests, so there is no error condition
# to key on and the threshold is harder to set than for failure-based rules.

index=main sourcetype=access_combined uri_path="/community/api/v2/coupon/validate-coupon" status=200
| bin _time span=1m
| stats count AS validations BY clientip, _time
| where validations > 10
